            "sid": "HEB 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ahadi ya Mlungu icherepho ya atu kuinjira phatuphe pha kuoya. Kpwa hivyo nahudzimanyirireni husedze hata mmwenga wehu akaonekana, akakosa kuinjira phatu hipho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Swino hwasikira habari nono kuhusu phatuphe pha kuoya dza arivyosikira akare ehu. Ela habari iyo taiyaaterya kpwa sababu taayakuluphira gara arigogomba Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 95:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisi humukuluphirao Mlungu ndio ndioinjira phatuphe pha kuoya. Ela kpwa hinyo asiomkuluphira Mlungu, waamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara akare ehu ariokala a mwandzo kuambirwa hizo habari nono, taayainjira phatuphe pha kuoya kpwa sababu arema kuphundza neno ra Mlungu. Ela ahadi bado icherepho ya anjina kuinjira phatuphe pha kuoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 95:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Mlungu wapanga siku, achiyiiha “rero.” Mana miaka minji bada ya hara ariokosa nafwasi, Mlungu wagomba tsona kuhusu habari za kuoya. Wagomba kutsupira Mfalume Daudi dza vira huchivyogomba kare,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ujumbe wa Mlungu u moyo na una nguvu sana. Tsona ni dza upanga urio na maso pande zosi mbiri, unaodunga kahi za mioyo na maroho gehu na kuganya vilungo vya mwiri na mafuha ga mifuphani. Piya ujumbe wa Mlungu unaweza kumanya maazo na nia za mioyo yehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuna chiumbe chochosi chirichofwitsika hata ikale Mlungu kachiona. Chila chitu chi laza mbereze. Naswi hundalavya isabu ya mahendo gehu mbereze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, manyani kukala huna mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu sana ariyephiya pho pharipho Mlungu mwenye. Hiye ndiye Jesu ambaye ni Mwana wa Mlungu. Kpwa hivyo nahugbwire na kudinisa gara hukuluphirago na kugashuhudiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mlavyadzi-sadaka wehu mkpwulu anaelewa unyonje wehu. Naye piya wajezwa kpwa chila njira ni Shetani dza vivyo sisi, ela kayahenda dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nahusengerereni pho pharipho na chihi cha endzi cha Mlungu bila wuoga, mana Mlungu ni mnono. Ndipho andahuterya wakati wa shida kpwa kuhujaliya na kuhuonera mbazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
